  "text": "QR ADMIN\nBranch\nAll restaurant\nUI Audit Restaurant A — Main Branch\nUI Audit Second Branch A\nSign out\nBrowse workspace\nQR ORDERING / LAUNCH SETUP\nPayment Settings\n\nControl online checkout and counter payments with clear collection status.\n\nEnabled\nBranch\nCurrent admin scope\nUI Audit Restaurant A — Main Branch\n\nRestaurant defaults apply until a branch overrides a setting. Other branches keep their own configuration.\n\nUse restaurant defaults\nSecure payment collection\n\nPayment collection is active and server credentials are configured. Available methods are determined by your merchant account in Razorpay checkout.\n\nRAZORPAY\nUNKNOWN\nEnabled for guests\n\nUPI and other methods are offered by the secure provider according to merchant activation. Configure credentials and collection approval through Super Admin. Secrets are never shown here.\n\nOnline payment\nCash at Counter\nPayment instructionsSave payment instructions\nFrom (restaurant date)\nTo (restaurant date)\nBranch\nCurrent admin scope\nUI Audit Restaurant A — Main Branch\n\nTimezone: Asia/Kolkata. Calendar days run midnight to midnight and include both selected dates. UTC export boundaries: 2026-10-07T18:30:00.000Z to 2026-10-14T18:30:00.000Z (exclusive).\n\n2\nOnline successes\n0\nFailed attempts\n1\nPending attempts\n₹206.00\nCollected payments\n₹102.00\nOutstanding at counter\n\nLanding sessions and menu views are deduplicated per code, signed browser session and restaurant day. Accepted orders exclude online drafts and cancellations. Gross paid sales include collected counter payments and verified online payments. Net sales subtract successful partial or full refunds for these orders. Conversion is an order-to-session ratio and may exceed 100% when a guest orders again.\n\nRecent online payment attempts\n10/13/2026, 9:42:34 PM\n₹103.00\nSUCCESS\npay_qa1791907955045\n10/13/2026, 9:41:29 PM\n₹103.00\nSUCCESS\npay_qa1791907890046\n10/13/2026, 9:39:43 PM\n₹103.00\nPENDING\nAwaiting provider",
